CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1786454320
OL,3,CMum who lost son to hidden condition
OL,4,Corganises screening event for young
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FA Plymouth mum who lost her son to an
OL,8,Fundiagnosed heart condition organised
OL,9,Fa heart screening event on Saturday (8
OL,10,FAugust) that saw nearly 100 young
OL,11,Fpeople attend.
OL,13,FJenny Thomas' son Nicholas was just 25
OL,14,Fyears old when he died in 2005 from
OL,15,FLong QT syndrome - a disorder of the
OL,16,Fheart's electrical activity that
OL,17,Fcauses sudden death.
OL,19,FShe believes a heart screening could
OL,20,Fhave picked up on his condition.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
