FL,408,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1786454320
OL,3,CMum who lost son to hidden condition
OL,4,Corganises screening event for young
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FMs Thomas organised the screening
OL,8,Fevent at the Woolwell Centre with
OL,9,Fcharity Cardiac Risk in the Young
OL,10,F(CRY), where she volunteers as the
OL,11,Frepresentative for Devon, inviting
OL,12,Fyoung people between the ages of 14 to
OL,13,F35 to get their hearts screened for
OL,14,Ffree.
OL,16,FThe charity say that one in 300 young
OL,17,Fpeople it screens has a potentially
OL,18,Flife-threatening cardiac condition,
OL,19,Fwhile every week in the UK healthy
OL,20,Fyoung people die of an undiagnosed
OL,21,Fcardiac condition.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,408,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1786454320
OL,3,CMum who lost son to hidden condition
OL,4,Corganises screening event for young
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,F"The point of screening is to try and
OL,8,Fpick up any issues that could be
OL,9,Ftreated - the majority of the time
OL,10,Fyoung people don't know they have a
OL,11,Fcardiac condition," Ms Thomas told ITV
OL,12,FNews.
OL,14,F"They might have symptoms they ignore,
OL,15,Fsuch as fainting or palpitations, but
OL,16,Fbecause most of these youngsters are
OL,17,Fvery active in sports and very fit,
OL,18,Fthey may not take much notice of it or
OL,19,Fdoctors may not pick up on it."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,408,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1786454320
OL,3,CMum who lost son to hidden condition
OL,4,Corganises screening event for young
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FShe adds that many young people may
OL,8,Fnot have any symptoms at all or may
OL,9,Fnot know they have a hereditary heart
OL,10,Fcondition.
OL,12,FThe event in Plymouth saw young people
OL,13,Ffrom across the West Country attend,
OL,14,Fincluding those from Glastonbury,
OL,15,FPenzance and Exeter and saw ten people
OL,16,Freferred for further investigation.
OL,18,FMs Thomas says, "If anything is picked
OL,19,Fup on the day, they will have an ECG,
OL,20,Fif there's anything noted on this,
OL,21,Fthey will then have an echocardiogram".
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,408,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1786454320
OL,3,CMum who lost son to hidden condition
OL,4,Corganises screening event for young
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FIf anything shows up on the
OL,8,Fechocardiogram, they are referred to a
OL,9,Fcardiologist or to a GP for referral.
OL,11,FThe event requires young people to
OL,12,Fregister in advance to attend.
OL,14,FMs Thomas became involved with CRY
OL,15,Ffollowing the loss of her son and she
OL,16,Fnow actively works with the charity to
OL,17,Forganise screening sessions, as well
OL,18,Fas offering telephone support to other
OL,19,Fmums.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
